{{Quote|This is what's left of the Great Forge. This was once the heart of our civilization. But the fires have been extinguished since the bombings.|[[Axe Woves]]|<ref name="Chapter 23">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 23: The Spies}}</ref>}}
The '''Great Forge''' was a [[forge]] located on [[Mandalore]]. It was large and ornate, and the air rang with the music of a hundred hammers. [[Bo-Katan Kryze]] and [[the Armorer]] visited the forge at some point.<ref name="Chapter 21" /> It was once the heart of the [[Mandalorian]] civilization, but the fires were extinguished during the [[Great Purge of Mandalore]]. The [[Mandalorian resistance|group]] of Mandalorians that were loyal to Kryze lived around the forge and survived by migrating along the surface until the war ended.<ref name="Chapter 23" /> After successfully retaking their [[homeworld]], Mandalorians from both Kryze's [[Bo-Katan Kryze's unit|unit]] and the Armorer's [[The Tribe|tribe]] celebrated the reactivation of the Great Forge.<ref name="Chapter 22">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 24: The Return}}</ref>

